WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Observe fictional institutional conditions. Examine how institutional conditions shape lived experience.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Conditions may shape reported experience.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sensory-participation evidence is population-limited.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Stress-attention evidence is context-dependent.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Self-report is not diagnosis; association is not causation.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
RN synthesis—not a universal body or brain effect.
